<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dollar Tree cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dollar Tree cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst George Strachan confirmed he cut his rating on Dollar Tree Stores Inc to outperform from recommended because the stock has been trading above his target price for a week.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The fundamental story is unfolding as expected,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 2-1/2 at 32.</p>
</text>
